      "Demonstrates authentication with DefaultAzureCredential and a Service Bus namespace.",
      "Provides examples for sending batches and receiving queue messages.",
      "Explains topic, subscription, session, and receive mode patterns.",
      "Covers dead-letter handling, scheduled messages, deferral, and message peeking."
